      "category": "breaking",
      "takeaway": "GMK CYL Video 2048 Hey everyone. Inspired by the color-coded shortcut keyboards that filled Mac editing suites in the mid-2000s, GMK Video 2048 brings back their visual language. Colored keycaps are grouped by function, each one carrying a pictographic pad-printed sublegend. A tribute to the post-production desk, where you learned a shortcut by its color first. I'm considering child kits, so please lelt me know your thoughts Renders Kits Thanks for the support. Special thanks to Oblotzky for the renders.",
